Package: simulab
Title: Unified Simulation of Statistical and Study Data
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Mohammed", "Saqr", email = "saqr@saqr.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Mohammed Saqr [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mohammed Saqr <saqr@saqr.me>
Description: Provides a consistent interface for simulating tidy data with
    known ground truth. Supported designs include declarative variable
    definitions, correlated and clustered data, treatment assignment,
    missingness, survival and competing risks, latent-variable and
    item-response models, longitudinal processes, event sequences, and static,
    bipartite, multiplex, temporal, and transition networks. Simulation
    outputs inherit from data.frame and expose parameters and design details
    through standardized tidy component tables. Seeded functions restore the
    caller's random-number state.
